<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lele-pi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6290056); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6290056&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609855057" alt="LeLe Pi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6290056)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lele-pi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6290056); return false;">LeLe Pi</a></span></p>
